cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference the Claim Preservation Profile, please cite it as below."
title: "Claim Preservation Profile"
abstract: >-
  An experimental specification and conformance corpus for preserving
  evidence-backed claim scope, qualifications, non-claims, assurance state, and
  observer validity across AI assurance pipelines. Experimental author proposal:
  not a standard, not adopted, not independently reviewed, not independently
  reproduced, not deployed.
type: software
